{"4816220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frutiger Aero Horror Alpha 2", "steam_appid": 4816220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816220/extras/00e2c6573c6b28627536a0ae9ae58f64.avif?t=1787212594\" width=1532 height=958 /></span>You are a tech enthusiast who loves flipping PCs and electronics as a hobby. Nothing beats the thrill of hunting for hidden gems, testing the hardware, and reselling it at double or triple the price. It’s a rewarding passion, until the day you encounter something you could never have foreseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started like any other successful day when you stumbled upon an unbelievable find at a local flea market: a complete Windows 7 desktop setup, including a monitor, keyboard, and mouse. Its specifications were impressive, and the price tag was simply too sweet to pass up. Driving home, your mind was consumed by a single goal: flipping this rig for three or four times its worth. For the dawn of 2015, the hardware was remarkably solid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back home, you immediately rushed to test your new prize. The PC fired up on the very first try. For a fleeting moment, you felt a surge of triumph until the desktop loaded. Suddenly, the screen exploded with a relentless torrent of error pop-ups, and the peripherals began moving erratically under a force of their own. Panicked, you lunged forward to yank the power cord from the outlet, but it was too late. A blinding force dragged you headfirst into the glowing monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments later, you find yourself stranded in a bizarre, futuristic landscape known only as Frutiger Aero. There isn't a living soul in sight. At least, that's what you think......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Frutiger Aero-style game, you'll explore empty, strange locations and solve puzzles. These locations are filled with strange creatures, and you'll eventually have to uncover their nature and the reason for their existence. Your main goal in this world is to survive and return to your own......</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816220/extras/00e2c6573c6b28627536a0ae9ae58f64.avif?t=1787212594\" width=1532 height=958 /></span>You are a tech enthusiast who loves flipping PCs and electronics as a hobby. Nothing beats the thrill of hunting for hidden gems, testing the hardware, and reselling it at double or triple the price. It’s a rewarding passion, until the day you encounter something you could never have foreseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started like any other successful day when you stumbled upon an unbelievable find at a local flea market: a complete Windows 7 desktop setup, including a monitor, keyboard, and mouse. Its specifications were impressive, and the price tag was simply too sweet to pass up. Driving home, your mind was consumed by a single goal: flipping this rig for three or four times its worth. For the dawn of 2015, the hardware was remarkably solid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back home, you immediately rushed to test your new prize. The PC fired up on the very first try. For a fleeting moment, you felt a surge of triumph until the desktop loaded. Suddenly, the screen exploded with a relentless torrent of error pop-ups, and the peripherals began moving erratically under a force of their own. Panicked, you lunged forward to yank the power cord from the outlet, but it was too late. A blinding force dragged you headfirst into the glowing monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments later, you find yourself stranded in a bizarre, futuristic landscape known only as Frutiger Aero. There isn't a living soul in sight. At least, that's what you think......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Frutiger Aero-style game, you'll explore empty, strange locations and solve puzzles. These locations are filled with strange creatures, and you'll eventually have to uncover their nature and the reason for their existence. Your main goal in this world is to survive and return to your own......</p>", "short_description": "You flip PCs as a hobby. An unbelievable flea market find from 2015 turns into a nightmare. The moment you boot this Windows 7 setup, a blinding force sucks you straight into the monitor. Now you are trapped in the strange futuristic world of Frutiger Aero. No soul is in sight. Or so it seems...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816220/d84dc746ee4c940fc5f117f65f95eb164f4ee685/header.jpg?t=1787212594", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816220/3ce99ea8ad2c6902d4df122c8c60daec2d36acf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787212594", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816220/3ce99ea8ad2c6902d4df122c8c60daec2d36acf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787212594", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or Intel Core i3-9100 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1070 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:<